# Keep the build context limited to Dockerfiles and explicit toolchain inputs.
# This allowlist keeps ignored ROMs, generated reference output, editor state, and
# future local-only files never become visible to a local or remote builder.
**
!Dockerfile
!.dockerignore
!toolchain/
!toolchain/mupen64plus-debug.sh
!toolchain/python-constraints.txt
!toolchain/Dockerfile.mupen-software
